// Pokemon - Gotta Catch 'Em All!
// Primary: RED (#DD0000) - Pokeball top, the iconic Pokemon red
// Secondary: WHITE/CREAM - Pokeball bottom
// Accents: YELLOW (Pikachu), BLACK (Pokeball band)
// Grey tint: NEUTRAL to slight warm red - like a clean Poke Center
// Automation: BLUE (#3B4CCA) - Pokemon logo blue, distinct from red/yellow
// Author: Claude

